repository-code: 'https://github.com/M-Colley/pedsumo'
abstract: >-
  PedSUMO extends Eclipse SUMO with demographic-dependent pedestrian crossing
  behaviour towards automated vehicles, so that the macroscopic traffic effects
  of external communication (eHMIs) and of pedestrians defying vehicle priority
  can be studied at city scale.
keywords:
  - automated vehicles
  - pedestrian simulation
  - eHMI
  - traffic simulation
  - SUMO
  - human-robot interaction
